.nh
.TH "PB-RELAY" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-relay - Inspect hosted and self-hosted relays


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb relay [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect hosted and self-hosted relays

.PP
Inspect relay regions and self-hosted relay installations selected by the account's relay pool. The list measures hosted network latency and labels self-hosted readiness separately.

.PP
With --json, this command group lists its available commands.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for relay


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP, \fBpb-relay-list(1)\fP
